  "goodToKnow": "Die Erbschaftssteuer (in the law Erbschaftsteuer) is inheritance tax. Spouses have a tax-free allowance of 500,000 euros and each child 400,000 euros per parent. Family businesses can be largely exempt, a rule the Constitutional Court has twice ordered to be revised. The parallel tax on gifts is die Schenkungssteuer. Revenues go to the federal states. Plural: die Erbschaftssteuern."
